          "canonical_heading": "OTHER LABORATORY TESTS",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Examination of a peripheral blood smear which exhibits hyposegmentation of all granulatocytes is all that is needed to diagnose PHA.",
